      "block_id": "page-0845-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "kinetic changes after surgery and interindividual variability, routinely switching to depot antipsychotics before \nsurgery may not be justified.7 However, depot preparations remain an option for those stabilised on treatment \navailable as a depot or in patients demonstrating signs of reduced bioavailability after surgery\n",
      "bbox": [
        74.88960266113281,
        344.5003967285156,
